<title>UK: MERRILL LYNCH SAYS SETS $300 MLN FOUR-YEAR BOND.</title>
<headline>MERRILL LYNCH SAYS SETS $300 MLN FOUR-YEAR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    21.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.31    PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.935    SPREAD	+41 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.AUG.00 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
